#: missions/crown_03/mission.json
msgid "All my life I have fought with a horse. In my old age I shall fight with a cart."
msgstr ""

#: ui/end_screen.gd
msgid "All places of power held for five minutes."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_02/mission.json
msgid "All three Smolensk banners fall"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_02/mission.json
msgid "All three Smolensk banners have fallen. The wings are torn apart."
msgstr ""

#: ui/ui_text.gd
msgid "Always on"
msgstr ""

#: ui/tips.gd
msgid "An alka, a pagan sanctuary. It gathers Power for spells and trains wise women; near it their spells recharge faster."
msgstr ""

#: ui/tips.gd
msgid "An archer at home in the forest."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_01/mission.json
msgid "An oak can be cut down. But the place where it grew is still here. Set stones in a circle, as your grandfather did, and the fire will come back."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_08/mission.json
msgid "An old oak above the stream. Grandfather spoke of such trees."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_03/mission.json
msgid "And about the grove?"
msgstr ""

#: missions/crown_03/mission.json
msgid "And if the wind changes?"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_08/mission.json
msgid "And my grandfather Jurij asked all his life that his brother be told he bore him no grudge."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_03/mission.json
msgid "And the next year the churches in Samogitia burned again. Great-grandfather took no part in it. But he gave away none of the people who burned them."
msgstr ""

#: missions/crown_06/mission.json
msgid "And the price is the same?"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_04/mission.json
msgid "And the straw broke, as Lord Jakub had said. The ones in front did not know what was with the ones behind, and the ones behind thought the ones in front were already being beaten."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_08/mission.json
msgid "And what if they are watching from the far bank?"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_03/mission.json
msgid "And who saw it, apart from you?"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_01/mission.json
msgid "And whose man are you?"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_08/mission.json
msgid "And will it?"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_03/mission.json
msgid "And you?"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_08/mission.json
msgid "Andrei Gintovt falls"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_05/mission.json
msgid "Andrei Gintovt falls or is left on the far bank"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_05/mission.json
msgid "Andrei Gintovt has fallen. His banner has nobody to carry it home."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_07/mission.json
msgid "Andrei Gintovt has fallen. Slutsk is left without his men."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_08/mission.json
msgid "Andrei Gintovt has fallen. The chronicler wrote his name in the list of the dead."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_05/mission.json
msgid "Andrei Gintovt stayed on the far bank and was taken captive along with the hetman."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_07/mission.json
msgid "Andrei Gintovt, Princess Anastasia or Prince Yuri falls"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_08/mission.json
msgid "Andrei stood by that oak longer than he needed to. The znakharka who rode with his men said afterwards that the oak gave her one mist, and no more."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_08/mission.json
msgid "Andrei takes off the old woven belt with the Samogitian pattern, his great-grandfather's, the one grandfather Jurij carried away east, and ties it on the lowest branch of the oak. Then he goes to his own and does not look back."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_08/mission.json
msgid "Andrei turns at a call. When he looks at the oak again, there is nobody under it."
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_08/mission.json
msgid "Andrei's men are thrown back into the Dnieper."
msgstr ""

#: missions/crown_02/mission.json
msgid "Another lord"
msgstr ""

#: missions/crown_06/mission.json
msgid "Another peasant"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_03/mission.json
msgid "Archbishop Jan"
msgstr ""

#: missions/gdl_01/mission.json
msgid "Archers among the trees are harder to hit. Let the spearmen hold the Order's men while your archers shoot from the forest."
msgstr ""

#: ui/tips.gd
